diagnostic_evidence.quote:
For $m\in\NN$ we say that a positive sequence $\bvarrho=(\varrho_j)_{j=1}^m$ is
\emph{$(\bb,\xi)$-admissible} if
\begin{equation*}\label{eq:adm}
	\sum_{j=1}^m b_j\varrho_j\leq \xi\,.
\end{equation*}
